,'MCN592019FGS0103','2','6008','Section 59','2020-10-15 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-09-10 00:00:00.000','2','Nobody came present  after publication. Proceedings exparte ordered.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2020-09-16 17:05:43.795','pschairperson','2020-09-16 17:05:43.795'),(9,5009,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','2','6008','Section 59','2020-11-18 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-10-15 00:00:00.000','3','letter issue to Regional Deputy Director, Patiala for project cost. Reminder to be issued',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2020-10-27 11:31:25.268','pschairperson','2020-10-27 11:31:25.268'),(11,5011,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','2','6008','Section 59','2020-12-17 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-11-18 00:00:00.000','5','Reminder to be issued to Regional Deputy Director, Patiala. Reply awaited',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2020-11-20 13:12:25.525','pschairperson','2020-11-20 13:12:25.525'),(12,5012,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','2','6008','Section 59','2021-01-14 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-12-17 00:00:00.000','6','	The Chairperson of the Authority is under home quarantine due to COVID-19 in family. Therefore, the case is adjourned.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-01-04 14:55:13.316','pschairperson','2021-01-04 14:55:13.316'),(14,5014,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','2','6008','Section 59','2021-02-18 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-01-14 00:00:00.000','8','The representative of the Authority states that a reminder has been issued to the Regional Deputy Director, Local Government to provide the required information vide Memo No. 281 dated 13.01.2021. He seeks more time. This is allowed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-01-21 10:04:44.141','pschairperson','2021-01-21 10:04:44.141'),(15,5015,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-03-25 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-02-18 00:00:00.000','9','The representative of the Authority states that the information sought from the Regional Deputy Director, Local Government vide Authority\'s Memo No. 281 dated 13.01.2021 is still awaited. He further states that a reminder is being issued to expedite the same. He seeks more time. This is allowed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-02-23 11:29:02.437','pschairperson','2021-02-23 11:29:02.437'),(16,5016,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-03-22 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-03-25 00:00:00.000','10','Reminder issued to Regional Deputy Director Patiala',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-08-09 15:43:28.385','pschairperson','2021-08-09 15:43:28.385'),(17,5017,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-04-22 00:00:00.000','','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-03-25 00:00:00.000','11','Reminder issued to Regional Deputy Director Patiala',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-08-09 16:49:49.229','pschairperson','2021-08-09 16:49:49.229'),(18,5018,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-05-27 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-04-22 00:00:00.000','12','The representative of the Authority states that the information sought from the Regional Deputy Director, Local Government vide Authority\'s Memo No. 2545 dated 12.04.2021 is still awaited. She seeks more time. This is allowed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-08-09 16:50:36.275','pschairperson','2021-08-09 16:50:36.275'),(19,5019,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-07-01 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-05-27 00:00:00.000','13','Perusal of the file reflects that despite various reminders no response has been received from Regional Deputy Director, Local Government, Patiala. The Secretary of the Authority is directed to take up the matter at personal level to expedite matters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-08-13 14:08:42.572','pschairperson','2021-08-13 14:08:42.572'),(20,5020,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-08-19 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2020-07-01 00:00:00.000','14','Perusal of the file reflects that despite various reminders no response has been received from Regional Deputy Director, Local Government, Patiala. The Secretary of the Authority is directed to take up the matter at personal level to expedite matters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-08-13 14:44:35.432','pschairperson','2021-08-13 14:44:35.432'),(21,5021,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-09-30 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2021-08-19 00:00:00.000','15','The representative of the Authority states that D.O letter was issued to Regional Deputy Director, Patiala on 19.07.2021 which has received back undelivered on 30.07.2021 with the report \'to send ADC, Mohali\'. The letter be dispatched to ADC, Urban Development Mohali for further necessary action.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-09-03 16:02:22.903','pschairperson','2021-09-03 16:02:22.903'),(22,5022,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-11-11 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2021-09-30 00:00:00.000','16','In compliance to order dated 19.08.2021, the D.O. letter issued to Regional Deputy Director, Patiala has been issued to ADC, Urban Development Mohali on 27.08.2021. The representative of the Authority states that the reply on the same is still awaited. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-10-05 17:28:48.609','pschairperson','2021-10-05 17:28:48.609'),(24,5024,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2021-12-30 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2021-11-11 00:00:00.000','18','The representative of the Authority states that the information sought from ADC, Urban Development, Mohali is still awaited. He further states that a reminder is being issued for the requisite information. He seeks more time. This is allowed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2021-12-30 15:39:06.163','pschairperson','2021-12-30 15:39:06.163'),(25,5025,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2022-01-18 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2021-12-30 00:00:00.000','19','The representative of the Authority states that the information sought from ADC, Urban Development, Mohali is still awaited. He further states that a reminder is being issued for the requisite information. He seeks more time. This is allowed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-01-19 14:08:40.957','pschairperson','2022-01-19 14:08:40.957'),(26,5026,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2022-01-25 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2022-01-18 00:00:00.000','20','The Chairperson is on leave. Matter adjourned',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-01-19 14:09:01.332','pschairperson','2022-01-19 14:09:01.332'),(27,5027,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2022-03-08 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2022-01-25 00:00:00.000','21','The representative of the Authority states that reply for the reminder issued to Deputy Commissioner, Amritsar vide Memo No. 8775 dated 26.11.2021 is still awaited. He further states that a reminder is being issued to expedite the same. He seeks more time. This is allowed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-02-02 11:58:31.686','pschairperson','2022-02-02 11:58:31.686'),(28,5028,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2022-04-05 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2022-03-08 00:00:00.000','22','The rep. of the Authority states that the ADC (Urban Development), SAS Nagar has verbally confirmed that they have no record related to the project in question. It is seen that the project is located in Fatehgarh Sahib.\r\nThe Secretary of the Authority is directed to issue a letter to Additional Deputy Commissioner (Urban Development), Fatehgarh Sahib to obtain the information.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:21:52.448','pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:21:52.448'),(29,5029,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2022-04-26 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2022-04-05 00:00:00.000','23','The rep. of the Authority states that the ADC (Urban Development), SAS Nagar has verbally confirmed that they have no record related to the project in question. It is seen that the project is located in Fatehgarh Sahib.\r\nThe Secretary of the Authority is directed to issue a letter to Additional Deputy Commissioner (Urban Development), Fatehgarh Sahib to obtain the information.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:22:49.667','pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:22:49.667'),(30,5030,103,'MCN592019FGS0103','1','6008','Section 59','2022-06-21 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770019','Ex-parte Proceedings','0','2022-04-26 00:00:00.000','24','A letter may be issued to the Additional Deputy Commissioner (Urban Development), Fatehgarh Sahib with reference to the above mentioned judgement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:23:47.370','pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:23:47.370'),(46,5031,1040,'MCN592022ASR0021','1','6008','Section 59','2022-07-22 00:00:00.000','10:30 AM','5505','Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member','770003','For Appearance and Reply','0','2022-07-13 00:00:00.000','1','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pamemberaps','2022-07-14 12:30:57.032','pamemberaps','2022-07-14 12:30:57.032'),(47,5032,1039,'MCN592022SAS0020','1','6008','Section 59','2022-07-22 00:00:00.000','10:30 AM','5505','Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member','770003','For Appearance and Reply','0','2022-07-13 00:00:00.000','1','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pamemberaps','2022-07-14 12:18:45.297','pamemberaps','2022-07-14 12:18:45.297'),(48,5033,1038,'MCN592022SAS0025','1','6008','Section 59','2022-07-29 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','5505','Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member','770003','For Appearance and Reply','0','2022-07-11 00:00:00.000','1','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pamemberaps','2022-07-13 11:57:09.205','pamemberaps','2022-07-13 11:57:09.205'),(49,5034,1037,'MCN592022SAS0026','1','6008','Section 59','2022-07-22 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','5505','Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member','770003','For Appearance and Reply','0','2022-07-11 00:00:00.000','1','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pamemberaps','2022-07-13 11:52:17.126','pamemberaps','2022-07-13 11:52:17.126'),(50,5035,1036,'MCN592022SAS0027','1','6008','Section 59','2022-07-22 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','5505','Sh. Ajay Pal Singh, Member','770003','For Appearance and Reply','0','2022-07-11 00:00:00.000','1','',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pamemberaps','2022-07-13 11:45:07.454','pamemberaps','2022-07-13 11:45:07.454'),(51,5036,1