 Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770006','Complaint Filed','0','2022-02-15 00:00:00.000','1','The real estate project has since been registered vide Registration number PBRERA-JAL33-PR0773. In view of this, the notice is accordingly filed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:38:12.151','pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:38:12.151'),(3710,8591,712,'MCN592019PTL0712','2','6008','Section 59','2022-04-05 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770007','For Final Order','0','2022-03-08 00:00:00.000','1','Once the license has been surrendered it is clear that the project is not to be taken up; and hence the question of its registration does not arise. This notice is accordingly filed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:43:54.980','pschairperson','2022-05-23 12:43:54.980'),(3713,8594,719,'MCN592019PTL0719','2','6008','Section 59','2022-04-05 00:00:00.000','9:30 AM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770006','Complaint Filed','0','2022-03-08 00:00:00.000','1','Once the license has been surrendered it is clear that the project is not to be taken up; and hence the question of its registration does not arise. This notice is accordingly filed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,1,'pschairperson','2022-05-24 12:58:15.401','pschairperson','2022-05-24 12:58:15.401'),(3714,8595,142,'MCN592019ASR0142','1','6008','Section 59','2022-01-25 00:00:00.000','2:30 PM','5501','Sh. Navreet Singh Kang, Chairperson','770016','Consideration','0','2021-11-25 00:00:00.000','1','Sh. Sandhu appeared and submitted that the respondent has applied for the approval of zoning plan / building plan of the project in question. The Chief Town Planner, Punjab had raised some observations through his Memo No. 6046 dated 01.10.2021 (a copy has been submitted). He sought two months\' time to attend to the observations and then move an application for registration of the project.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,1,1,1,'pscha